    "chunk_text": "Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nwxl 2441$22 \u2013 2025 cqks ui 18 jeks nodod \u2013 2025'06'18\n\nNo. 2441/22 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 18, 2025\n\nSABARAGAMUWA PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nFirst Supplementary Financial Statement - 2025\n\nGRANTING PERMISSION BY VIRTUE OF POWERS VESTED IN ME UNDER SECTION 27(A) OF PROVINCIAL\n\nCOUNCIL ACT, No. 42 OF 1987 AS THE TERM OF THE SABARAGAMUWA PROVINCIAL COUNCIL OF THE\n\nDEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA ENDED ON 26TH SEPTEMBER, 2017\n\n2025\n\n1. This permission may be cited as \u2018\u2018Permission to disburse under the First supplementary Financial Statement - 2025 of\n\nthe Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council\u201d and come in to operation from 04.04.2025.\n\n2. The expenditure of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council which is estimated Rupees Sixty One Billion Seven Hundred\n\nThirty Eight Million One Hundred Thirty Eight Thousand only (Rs. 61,738,138,000.00) for the service of the period beginning on 01st of January, 2025 and ending 31st December 2025, which is specified as \u2018\u2018Financial Year 2025\u201d in the Annual Financial Statement and Revenue - Expenditure Estimates prepared for the year 2025, is hereby amended as, Rupees Sixty Two Billion Two Hundred Eight Million Fifty Five Thousand Eighty Two and Twelve Cents only (Rs.62,208,055,082.12) and grant permission to the Chief Secretary of this Province and other Accounting Officers to disburse the same from the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council Fund.\n\n3. Accordingly the first schedule of the Annual Financial Statement and revenue- expenditure estimates - 2025, is amended\n\nas the first schedule hereof and grant permission to disburse the same.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 PG 7158 \u2013 09 (06/2025)"
