    "chunk_text": "I do hereby grant permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council to spend a sum of Rupees Sixty One Billion Seven Hundred Thirty Eight Million One Hundred and Thirty Eight Thousand only, (Rs. 61,738,138,000) out of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council Fund, which is estimated for the expenses of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council for the one year period that starts on 01st of January, 2025 and end on 31st of December, 2025, by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 27 (a) of the Provincial Council Act No. 42 of 1987, as the term of the 06th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka ended on 26th September, 2017.\n\nA.A.C.J. Rajarathne, Hon. Governor - Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n03rd day of April, 2025.\n\nEOG 06-0154/2__________________\n\nAUTHORIZATION\n\nI do hereby grant permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council to bear the expenses stated in the Second (II) Schedule, which is estimated for the Advance Account Activities of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council for the one year period that starts on 01st of January, 2025 and end on 31st December, 2025, by virtue of powers vested in me under Section 27 (a) of the Provincial Council Act No. 42 of 1987, as the term of the 06th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka ended on 26th September, 2017. Accordingly, I do hereby grant permission to the Chief Secretary and the Accounting Officers of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council to bear the expenses subject to those limits.\n\nThis permission will be valid till 31st December, 2025 or upto the date that expires 03 months from the date of summoning the 07th Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council or from the date re-start the functions of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council which occurs first.\n\nA.A.C.J. Rajarathne, Hon. Governor - Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n03rd day of April, 2025.\n\nEOG 06-0154/3"
