    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2441/18 - 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 18 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.18 No. 2441/18 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 18, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\n,, Notice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No.: KDS/TUM/4/1/6/7. Ministry of Land Reference No.: 4-3/7/2019/HW/16.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acqisition (Amendment) No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/ Servitude* which is required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the land or Servitude to be acquired:\n\nUndermentioned land shown in the Surveyor General\u2019s plan of CM 321271 Block No. 01 Sheet No. 1, situated in the Village of Morawaddeniya in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 301 Galagedara West, in Thumpane Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Kandy District of Central Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Kospothu Oya; Description: Oya; Claimant: Government, Original Claimant; - ; Extent: 0.0012 Hectare. 2. Lot No. 3 Name of the Land: - ; Description: Ela; Claimant: Government, Original Claimant; - ; Extent: 0.0021 Hectare. 3. Lot No. 4 Name of the Land: Aswedduma, Bogahalande Kumbura, Oyagawa Aswedduma and Gedaragawa Aswedduma; Description: Estate; Claimant: Government, Original Claimant; Mahinda Bandara (Died), Erandathi Bandara, Ronald Padmasiri Bandara, Lakshman Chandrabaya Bandara, Sarojani Bandara, Malathi Bandara, Sunil Perakum Bandara, Kalyani Bandara, Darshani Bandara, Jayanthi Indrani Bandara, Nayana Bandara, Mervin Krishantha Bandara, Sarath Nalaka Bandara, Chandrakanthi Jayalakshmi Bandara, Dayani Bandara, Janaka Nishantha Bandara; Extent: 0.0484 Hectare.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS Land Acquisition Notices\n\n1A G 044560 - 34 (06/2025)"
