    "chunk_text": "2. Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited - Jaffna Branch, shall conduct the degree programmes specified in Schedule 11 hereto, only at No.239, Arasady Road, Kantharmadam, Jaffna.\n\n3. Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited - Jaffna Branch shall, when admitting students for the degree programmes specified in Schedule II hereto, adhere to the minimum entry qualifications approved in respect of therefor, by the Specified Authority.\n\n4. The responsibility for the proper conduct of academic activities and awarding the degrees specified in Schedule II hereto upon fulfilment of the prescribed qualifications for the students enrolled at the Jaffna Branch of the Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited shall lie entirely with the Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited, Malabe.\n\nSchedule II\n\nColumn IDegreeColumn IIAbbreviations for DegreeBachelor of Science (Honours) in Information TechnologyBSc Hons (Information Technology)\n\nBachelor of Business Administration HonoursBBA Hons\n\nDr. Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Education. Higher Education and Vocational Education.\n\nColombo,12th June, 2025.\n\nEOG 06 - 0133\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
