    "chunk_text": "1. Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited - Kandy Branch, shall be recognized to offer the Degrees specified in Schedule II hereto, subject to the five (5) year review conducted by the Specified Authority from the date of publication of this Order.\n\n2. Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited - Kandy Branch, shall conduct the degree programmes specified in Schedule II hereto, only at Balagolla, Kengalla, Kandy.\n\n3. Sri Lanka Institute of Information Technology (Guarantee) Limited - Kandy Branch shall, when admitting students for the degree programmes relevant to the degree specified in Schedule II hereto, adhere to the minimum entry qualifications approved in respect of therefor, by the Specified Authority.\n\nSchedule II\n\nColumn IDegreeColumn IIAbbreviations for DegreeBachelor of Science (Honours) in InformationTechnologyBSc Hons (Information Technology)\n\nBachelor of Business Administration HonoursBBA Hons\n\nDr. Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Education. Higher Education and Vocational Education.\n\nColombo,12th June, 2025.\n\nEOG 06 - 0132\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
