    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'06'17PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.06.2025\n\n1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2441$08 \u2013 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0dd6\u0db1\u0dd2 ui 17 jeks \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd0\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025'06'17\n\nNo. 2441/08 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 17, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 044570\u2013 10 (06/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nOrder under proviso (a) to Section 38\n\nOrder No. 30 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No. : 4-3/07/2020/HW/168.Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: DIVNA/LND/LA/ACQUI/4/1/34\n\nBy virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460), I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby direct the Acquiring Officer or any other officer authorised by him referred to in Paragraph of the I Schedule to take immediate possession of the land specified in the corresponding entry in paragraph II of that Schedule.\n\nK.D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\"Mihikatha Medura\", No.1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,09th April, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nI. Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Narammala."
