    "chunk_text": "Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\"Mihikatha Medura\", No.1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,09th April, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nI. Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Narammala.\n\n02. Lot 'B' Assadduma Kumbura - Extent: 0.0133 Hectare North: Assadduma Kumbura claimed by A. Heenmanika and Central Expressway; East: Lot A, Assadduma Peellawa claimed by A. M. G. R. Adhikari, Assadduma Kumbura\n\nIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'06'17PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 17.06.2025 2A\n\nclaimed by A. Heenmanika and Lots C; South: Assadduma Peellawa claimed by A. M. G. R. Adhikari, Lot C and D; West: Lot D, Assadduma Kumbura claimed by I. A. Manika and Assadduma Kumbura claimed by A. Heenmanika.\n\n03. Lot 'C'- Assadduma Peellawa - Extent: 0.0001 Hectare North: Lot B and Assadduma Kumbura claimed by A. Heenmanika; East: Assadduma Peellawa claimed by A. M. G. R. Adhikari; South: Assadduma Kumbura claimed by I. A. Manika and Lots D; West: Lots D and B.\n\n04. Lot 'D'- Assadduma Kumbura - Extent: 0.0703 Hectare North: Assadduma Kumbura claimed by I. A. Manika, Assadduma Kumbura claimed by A. Heenmanika, Lots. B, C and Assadduma Peellawa claimed by A. M. G R. Adhikari; East: Assadduma Peellawa claimed by A. M. G. R. Adhikari, Assadduma Kumbura claimed by I. A. Manika, Lots E, F, G and H; South: Lots G, H, J and Assadduma Kumbura claimed by P. R. U. S. Bandara; West: Assadduma Kumbura claimed by P. R. U. S. Bandara and Assadduma Kumbura claimed by 1. A. Manika.\n\n05. Lot 'E'- Assadduma Peellawa - Extent: 0.0032 Hectare North: Lots D and Assadduma Kumbura claimed by I. A. Manika; East: Assadduma Peellawa claimed by A. M. G R. Adhikari; South: Assadduma Peellawa claimed by P. R. S. S. Adhikari and Lot F; West: Lot D."
