    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2441$02 - 2025 cqks ui 16 jeks i\u00f7od - 2025'06'16No. 2441/02 - MONDAY, JUNE 16, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\n1A - PG 7150 - 05 (06/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nLocal Government Notifications\n\nKURUNEGALA MUNICIPAL COUNCIL\n\nAlternative routies that can be used during the 100th Sri Dalada Poson Perahera at the Athkanda Rajamaha Viharaya in Kurunegala\n\nIn terms of Section 04 of the \u201cBy-law on Halting and Handling of Vehicles\u201d of Kurunegala Municipal Council Published in the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka No. 1921 dated 26th June 2015 and by virtue of the powers vested in me by Chapter 252 Municipal Council Ordinance and Sri Lanka Law Statutes Code, I hereby announce and publicize that, whereas, the annual Sri Dalada Poson Perahera Pageant will be held at the Athkanda Rajamaha Viharaya in Kurunegala on the 23rd, 24th and 25th of June 2025, vehicular traffic on the following roads will be restricted during the period of the said Perahera Pageant and since vehicle traffic may be restricted on the following routes where the Perahera Pageant is taken place during that period, the following alternative road facilities have been provided for uninterrupted travel during that period.\n\nPerahera Pageant Route\n\nDates : 23rd and 24th June 2025 (Perahera Pageant starts at 4.00 PM)\n\nAthkanda Rajamaha Viharaya \u2013 Rajapihilla Road \u2013 Holy Family School Road \u2013 Mihindu Road \u2013 Puttalam Road \u2013 Clock Tower Junction \u2013 Kandy Road \u2013 Athkanda Rajamaha Viharaya.\n\n25th June 2025 (Perahera Pageant starts at 7.30 PM)\n\nAthkanda Rajamaha Viharaya \u2013 Rajapihilla Road \u2013 Police Station \u2013 Clock Tower Junction \u2013 Puttalam Road \u2013 D.B.Welagedara Mawatha (Main Street) \u2013 Parakumba Street \u2013 Dambulla Road \u2013 Clock Tower Junction \u2013 Kandy Road \u2013 Athkanda Rajamaha Viharaya."
  },
