    "chunk_text": "Athkanda Rajamaha Viharaya \u2013 Rajapihilla Road \u2013 Police Station \u2013 Clock Tower Junction \u2013 Puttalam Road \u2013 D.B.Welagedara Mawatha (Main Street) \u2013 Parakumba Street \u2013 Dambulla Road \u2013 Clock Tower Junction \u2013 Kandy Road \u2013 Athkanda Rajamaha Viharaya.\n\nNo.Restricted RoadAlternative Roads\n\n01.\n\nVehicles Coming along the Kurunegala - Dambulla Road\n\nVehicles heading towards ColomboTurn Left near regional workshop of Sri Lanka Transport Board, follow Gettuwana Circular Road, cross Gettuwana Junction, take south circular Road to Nawinna Junction, and turn left at Nawinna Junction towards Colombo.\n\nVehicles heading towards Negombo RoadAfter passing Lakdas de Mel College on the Dambulla Road, turn right, follow South Lake Round Road, then Kadireshan Kovil Road, reach Puttalam Road, turn left at Puttalam Junction and turn right and proceed towards Negombo\n\nVehicles heading towards KandyTurn left near regional workshop of Sri Lanka Transport Board, follow Gettuwana circular road, cross Gettuwana Junction and turn left and proceed towards Kandy\n\nVehicles heading towards PuttalamFrom Polattapitiya Junction, take North Lake Round Road, cross Welangolla Junction and turn right at Yanthanpalawa Junction and proceed towards Puttalam\n\nOnly Passenger buses with destination of Kurunegala Bus Stand\n\nAllowing entry to the bus stand via the same routes as before.\n\n02.Vehicles coming along Kurunegala - Kandy Road\n\nVehicles heading towards ColomboTurn left at Gettuwana Junction and follow south circular road and turn left at Nawinna Junction and proceed towards Colombo.\n\nVehicles heading towards NegomboTurn left at Gettuwana Junction and follow south circular road to the Nawinna Junction, then turn left at puwakgas junction and proceed towards Negombo along Bauddhaloka Mawatha."
