    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.13PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.06.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nANIMAL DISEASES ACT, NO. 59 OF 1992\n\nOrder Under Section 5 and Consequential Arrangements\n\nAFRICAN Swine Fever (ASF) is a speci\ufb01ed and highly contagious disease as de\ufb01ned in the First Schedule of the Animal Diseases Act, No. 59 of 1992, and the Orders made thereunder. It is a disease that may occur in any Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Sri Lanka.\n\nI, Kasthuri Arachchige Chandrika Hemali Abeyrathna Kothalawala, Director General of Animal Production and Health, by virtue of the powers vested in me under the above Act, do hereby declare by this Order that:\n\n1. All Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisions in Sri Lanka are hereby declared as infected or susceptible areas for African Swine Fever (ASF) for the purposes and within the meaning of the Animal Diseases Act.\n\n1. The pig (Sus scrofa) is the susceptible species for this disease; and\n\n2. This Order shall come into force on the date of its publication in the Gazette and, unless earlier revoked or further extended under Section 5(3) of the Act, shall remain in effect for a period of three months from the date of such publication.\n\n1A \u2013 G 044559 \u2013 05(06/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a \u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2440/242440/24 \u2013 \u2013 20252025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 1313 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 \u2013 2025.06.132025.06.13No. 2440/24 \u2013No. 2440/24 \u2013 FRIDAY, JUNE 13, 2025 FRIDAY, JUNE 13, 2025\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.13\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.06.2025 2A"
  },
