    "chunk_text": "\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a \u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2440/242440/24 \u2013 \u2013 20252025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 1313 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 \u2013 2025.06.132025.06.13No. 2440/24 \u2013No. 2440/24 \u2013 FRIDAY, JUNE 13, 2025 FRIDAY, JUNE 13, 2025\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.13\n\nPART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.06.2025 2A\n\nI. Under Section 5(4) of the Animal Diseases Act, the removal, transportation, driving, or movement of pigs, pork, pork products, or risk material within, to, or from the infected or susceptible area without a permit issued by the Divisional Government Veterinary Surgeon of the respective Division, as per Form VII of the regulations published in Gazette No. 1108/23 dated December 03, 1999.\n\nII. The slaughter of susceptible animals (pigs) for meat purposes.\n\nIII. Holding or conducting live animal markets involving susceptible animals.\n\nIV. Sale, display for sale, offering for sale, storage, supply, distribution, or further processing of pigs, pork, pork products, or infected materials without a permit issued by an Authorized Of\ufb01cer nominated in this Order.\n\nV. Without complying with the guidelines issued by the Department of Animal Production and Health, dispose of any carcass, part thereof, or contaminated material by placing it in any water body or leaving it in any location in a manner that may allow other animals to access, consume, or transport such materials to other places.\n\nVI. Slaughtering, storing, or processing in any slaughterhouse, storage facility, or meat processing center that is not approved by an Authorized Of\ufb01cer nominated in this Order.\n\n3. Animals in non-infected breeder, fattener, or commercial farms may be bred, sold, slaughtered, or processed, subject to the following conditions:\n\nI. The breeder farms must be registered with the Animal Breeding Division of the Department of Animal Production and Health, Peradeniya."
  },
