    "chunk_text": "3. Animals in non-infected breeder, fattener, or commercial farms may be bred, sold, slaughtered, or processed, subject to the following conditions:\n\nI. The breeder farms must be registered with the Animal Breeding Division of the Department of Animal Production and Health, Peradeniya.\n\nIII. A copy of the health certi\ufb01cate and the test report of purchased, transported, or slaughtered animals must be retained at the respective farm or slaughterhouse.\n\n4. Admitting animals to affected farms\n\nI. Before restocking, the farm must obtain a certi\ufb01cate from the range Veterinary Surgeon certifying that the premises have been properly disinfected and are in compliance with the prescribed biosecurity measures.\n\n5. By virtue of, and in the exercise of, the powers vested in me under the provisions of the Animal Diseases Act, I hereby nominate the following of\ufb01cers as Authorized Of\ufb01cers for the purposes of Section 3(3) of the Act, to take action to prevent the commission of prohibited activities set out in Paragraph 02(1) of this Order, and to exercise the powers of an Authorized Of\ufb01cer under Sections 13 and 14 of the Animal Diseases Act for that purpose:\n\n1. Director-Animal Health, Department of Animal Production and Health\n\n2. Director-Wildlife Health, Department of Wildlife and Conservation\n\n3. Chief Municipal Veterinary Surgeon-Municipal Councils\n\n4. The Provincial Directors of Animal Production and Health of each Province\n\n3AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.13PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 13.06.2025\n\n5. Subject Matter Specialist of each Province\n\n6. Deputy Director - Animal Health, Department of Animal Production and Health\n\n7. The Deputy Directors of Animal Production and Health in charge of each District and District Veterinary Surgeons\n\n8. The Veterinary Investigation Of\ufb01cers of each District"
