    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2440$22 - 2025 cqks ui 12 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2025.06.12No. 2440/22 - THURSDAY, JUNE 12, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A- PG 7149 - 05 (06/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nNOTICE UNDER SECTION 10 (3) OF THE SRI LANKA ELECTRICITY ACT, No. 20 OF 2009 (AMENDED)\n\nIssuance of Certificate of Exemption\n\nTHE Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka, exercising its powers under Section 10 (2) of the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009 as amended hereby issues a Certificate of Exemption to the following category of persons exempting them from the requirment of obtaining a license for the generation of electricity.\n\nCertificate No.Exempted PartyEffective Period\n\nEL/EX/G/25-01\n\nCategory of Persons generating electricity using Rooftop Solar Photo Voltaic (RTSPV) system with one of the following technical configurations:\n\na. One Meter and One Accountb. Two Meters and One Accountc. Two Meters and Two Accounts\n\nUntil revoked and/or amended by the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka.\n\nChairman, Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka.The aforesaid exemption shall be subject ot the following conditions:\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'12Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 12.06.20252A\n\n1. Definitions and Interpretations\n\n\u25cf Definitions\n\nIn these conditions, unless otherwise specified or the context otherwise requires:\n\n\u201cAct\u201dmeans the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009 (as amended)\u201cCommission\u201dmeans the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka established under the PUCSL Act.\u201cDistribution Licensee\u201dmeans the holder of a license to distribute electricity granted under Section 13(1) (c) (i) (c) of the Act."
