    "chunk_size_bytes": 2016,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cAct\u201dmeans the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of 2009 (as amended)\u201cCommission\u201dmeans the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka established under the PUCSL Act.\u201cDistribution Licensee\u201dmeans the holder of a license to distribute electricity granted under Section 13(1) (c) (i) (c) of the Act.\n\nEnvironmental Laws\u201d\n\nmeans those laws which are, from time to time, in force for the purpose of protecting the environment, including human health, flora, fauna and the eco-systems on which they depend and, for the avoidance of doubt, shall include, but shall not be limited to, the National Environment Act, No. 47 of 1980 and all relevant legislation relating to the assessment of environmental impacts and the protection of air, land and water.\n\n\u201cExempted Person\u201dmeans any person who is part of a category of persons exempted from the requirement of obtaining a licence for the generation of electricity as specified in Section 10(1) of the Act.\n\n\u201cGenerating Facility\u201dmeans any plant, equipment, apparatus or appliance including interconnection, protective and control equipment used for, or in connection with, the generation of electricity for the purpose of delivery to the Licensee\u2019s distribution network.\n\n\u201cInformation\u201dmeans and includes any books, documents, records, accounts, estimates, returns, reports or other date (whether prepared specifically at the request of the Commission or otherwise) in any format or medium as may be specified by the Commission.\u201cNotice\u201dmeans this Gazette Notice issued under Section 10 (2) of the Act. \u201cPUCSL Act\u201dmeans the Public Utilities Commission of Sri Lanka Act, No. 35 of 2002.\n\n\u201cSite\u201dmeans the premises at which the Generating Facility is operated and maintained by the Exempted Person.\n\n\u201cStandard Tariff Agreement\u201d\n\nThe standard agreement for electricity supply to the Premises between the Tariff Customer and the Distribution Licensee entered into under and in terms of Section 25 (4) of the Act and the Supply Services Code."
