    "chunk_text": "The standard agreement for electricity supply to the Premises between the Tariff Customer and the Distribution Licensee entered into under and in terms of Section 25 (4) of the Act and the Supply Services Code.\n\n\u25cf Interpretations\n\nFor the purposes of this document, the following terms shall have the meanings assigned below:\n\n\u25cf Meter (in the One Meter and One Account scenario):\n\nThe electricity meter supplied and installed by the Distribution Licensee for the purpose of recording the net electrical energy imported to and/or exported from the Site.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'12Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 12.06.2025\n\n3A\n\n\u25cf Meters (in the Two Meters and One Account and Two Meters and Two Accounts scenarios):\n\nRefers to the following electricity meters supplied and installed by the Distribution Licensee:\n\na) A meter for recording the total electrical energy imported to the Site; and\n\nb) A meter for recording the total electrical energy exported by the Generating Facility.\n\n\u25cf Account (in the One Meter and One Account and Two Meters and One Account scenarios):\n\nThe electricity account created by the Distribution Licensee and assigned to the Tariff Customer in accordance with the terms of the Standard Tariff Agreement.\n\n\u25cf Accounts (in the Two Meters and Two Accounts scenario):\n\nRefers to the following:\n\na) The electricity account created by the Distribution Licensee and assigned to the Tariff Customer under the Standard Tariff Agreement; and\n\nb) A designated account created by the Distribution Licensee specifically assigned to the Generating Facility, to record the electrical energy exported by the Generating Facilitiy.\n\n2. Compliance with Regulatory Instruments"
  },
