    "md5": "9aa8ae99a1318ce2f5c8bbc8409b59d8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1943,
    "chunk_text": "b) A designated account created by the Distribution Licensee specifically assigned to the Generating Facility, to record the electrical energy exported by the Generating Facilitiy.\n\n2. Compliance with Regulatory Instruments\n\n3. Decisions, Orders, Directions and Determinations of the Commission\n\n(i) The Exempted Person shall ensure all decisions, orders, directions and determinations made by the Commission are complied with in the installation, operation and maintenance of the Generating Facility.\n\n(ii) The reasonable costs associated with such compliance shall be the responsibility of the Exempted Person.\n\n4. Provision of Information to the Commission\n\nThe Exempted Person shall ensure the Commission is furnished with Information in such manner and at such times as the Commission may require and in such format as the Commission may consider necessary or as it may require for the purpose of performing the functions assigned or transferred to it by or under the Act or the PUCSL Act.\n\n5. Access\n\n(i) The Exempted Person shall, subject to prior notification, permit any officer duly authorized by the Commission, including but not limited to Electrical Inspectors, to enter the Site. Such officer shall have the right to inspect the Exempted Person\u2019s Generating Facility, as well as any equipment, infrastructure, software application or related records pertaining to the same, and to review all relevant documentation.\n\n(ii) Where the Exempted Person is not the owner/occupant of the Site, the Exempted Person shall obtain permission from the owner/occupant of the Site for such person to enter the Site. Provided however, the requirement to provide notice shall be waived in case of an emergency.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'12Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 12.06.20254A\n\n6. Grid Connection & Operation"
  },
