    "chunk_size_bytes": 1926,
    "chunk_text": "Provincial Councils Notifications\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'12Part IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 12.06.20252A\n\nOrder\n\n2. This order is cited as the order relating to the payment of allowances to the Mayor, Deputy Mayor and members of the\n\nRatnapura Municipal Council and the Kegalle Municipal Council in the Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n3. The allowances payable to the Mayor, Deputy Mayor and members of the Ratnapura Municipal Council and the Kegalle Municipal Council shall be as hereinafter provided provisions, until empowering the orders issued under Section 289 of the Municipal Councils Ordinance, in Chapter 252, relating to the payment of allowances to the Mayor, Deputy Mayor and members of the Municipal Councils in the Sabaragamuwa Province. 4. The monthly allowances payable to the Mayor, Deputy Mayor and members of the Municipal Council shall be in accordance with the policy decisions taken by the Government in this regard from time to time and shall be paid in the following month for the month passed, subject to the maximum limits so prescribed.\n\n5. Any Mayor, Deputy Mayor and member shall not be entitled to allowances under the following circumstances:\n\n(1) In the case of a member of the Municipal Council who has been suspended from the business of the Municipal Council under the By-laws on the Business of Municipal Council Meetings, for the period of such suspension, (2) For the period of arrest , in custody or imprisonment , under the Bribery or Corruption Commission Act or for any other criminal charge,\n\n(3) For the period of absence from the ordinary meetings of the Council, with or without the permission of the Municipal Council, except when on leave on medical grounds or for other official business of the Municipal Council with the permission of the Municipal Council."
