    "chunk_text": "(3) For the period of absence from the ordinary meetings of the Council, with or without the permission of the Municipal Council, except when on leave on medical grounds or for other official business of the Municipal Council with the permission of the Municipal Council.\n\n6. The total monthly subsistence allowance and travelling allowance to be paid to the Mayor, Deputy Mayor and members for attending meetings of a Municipal Council shall not exceed Rs. 8000.00 taking into account the income in the annual budget of the relevant Municipal Council.\n\n7. The Mayor, Deputy Mayor and member, when applying for allowances under sub-section (6) above, shall submit a declaration in the form included in the Appendix to these regulations, together with a formal travelling voucher for the relevant month in the following month.\n\n8. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala, Tamil and English texts of this regulation, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n3AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'06'12Part IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 12.06.2025\n\nAppendix\n\nDeclaration regarding the request for subsistence allowance and travel allowance\n\nMunicipal Council ...................................................\n\nSubsistence allowance ..............................................................................\n\nName of the Post Holder ..........................................................................\n\nPost: Mayor /Deputy Mayor /Member\n\nFor travel to the following locations for ................................................. Municipal Council business\n\n1. Amount incurred for the use of a private vehicle (maximum Rs. 20 per kilometer for a car / maximum Rs. 10 per kilometer for a motorcycle or three-wheeler)\n\n2. Subsistence allowance\n\n3. Requested Amount"
