    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 1 : 55 of Block 3, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 421861, situated in the Village of Bakmigolla within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 522 - Bakmigolla in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Ibbagamuwa, in the District of Kurunegala, in the Province of North Western, referred to in Notice No. 42/0947 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2371/63 of 17th February, 2024 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 09th April, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2440/12 - 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 11 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.11\n\nNo. 2440/12 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 11, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 044549 - 04 (06/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0