    "chunk_text": "III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.11\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 11.06.20251A\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialis t Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2440/03 \u2013 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 11 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.06.11\n\nNo. 2440/03 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 11, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b P\u0d8b\u0d88\u0d8f\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d88 (a) S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38\n\nOrder No. 51 of 2025\n\nMy Ref No.: 4-3/10/2018/LRB/383. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: KSWD&EIP/ACQ/SMC/04/(16/2021) BY virtue of powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 of Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of that Schedule. K. D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,06th June, 2025.\n\n1A \u2013 G 044539 \u2013 09 (06/2025)\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Kolonnawa Stormwater Drainage & Environment Improvement Project.\n\n2. Description of the land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted in below name and extent in the Advaned Tracing No. CO/KLN/2023/114 dated 26.12.2024 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Mulleriyawa and Kelanimulla village in No. 501, Mulleriyawa North, No. 504, Kelanimulla and No. 504A, Belagama Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kolonnawa in Colombo District of Western Provice and bounded as:"
