    "chunk_text": "III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01ce \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.06.2025 1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2439/63 - 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.05\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2439/63 - 2025 \u0151\u01e7 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.06.052439/63 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 05, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G044526 \u2013 14 (06/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 44 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 13/96/FR/669. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: \u0d89/01/34/8/35. BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Order under Section 38 (a) of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to in paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in paragraph 2 of that Schedule. K. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.09th April 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Kalawana."
