    "chunk_text": "Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.09th April 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Kalawana.\n\nEOG 06-0067\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01ce \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.06.05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.06.2025 2A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 41 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 03J/92/FR/104. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: \u0dbd/\u021d\u0dcf\u0dd9\u0262/3/3/7/6. BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Order under Section 38 (a) of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to in paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in paragraph 2 of that Schedule. K. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.20th May 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Laggala.\n\n2. Description of the land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Preliminary Plan No. TopoPP. 13 dated 30.05.2006 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Pallegama and Leloya villages in Laggala Pallesiya Pattuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Laggala Pallegama in Matale District of Central Province and bounded as: 01. Lot No. 2679 \u2013 Wattegedara Hena \u2013 Extent: 6.346 Hectares North: Lot Nos. 2013 and 1256; East: Lot Nos. 1256,1250,102,1251, 101, 1252, 101, 1253, 101, 1254, 102 and 1256; South: Lot No. 1256; West: Lot No. 2013."
