    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'01'18P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 18.01.2025 1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2013 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nLocal Government Noti\ufb01 cations\n\nwxl 2439$60 \u2013 2025 cQks ui 05 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2025'06'05No. 2439/60 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 05, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 PG 7142\u2013 06 (06/2025)\n\nPRADESHIYA SABHA - KURUWITA\n\nThe roads and lanes which are deem to be owned by Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha in which are relevant noti\ufb01 cation is included published in the Gazette No. 2415/41 dated 18.12.2024 under the terms made by section 24 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of the 1987 as the \"orders on the preparation of plans and posting of notices showing the list of names of the roads and lanes\" maintained by the Pradeshiya Sabha of Sabaragamuwa Province as the Honourable Governor of Sabaragamuwa Province has publish in the Special Gazette No. 2316/20 dated 24 January 2023 and it is hereby published for the public that it has been decided under decision No. 17 of 30th May 2025 that all said road and lanes shall be owned by Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha as because of any case has not been assigned in a competent court on the date \ufb01 xed by the said noti\ufb01 cation.\n\nIt is further announced that all roads and lanes included therein shall be deemed to be roads lanes established by the Kuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha under sub section (5) of section 24 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act list of those road and lanes is included in the schedule here.\n\nE.K. I\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d82\u0d84\u0d7a P\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d8c\u0d7a\u0d7d K\u0d8e\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d7a, Secretary and the Implementation O\ufb03 cer, Carrying out the Function, Pradeshiya Sabha - Kuruwita.\n\nKuruwita Pradeshiya Sabha,Kuruwita.30th May 2025."
