    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'06'06PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.06.2025\n\n1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Redemption Notices\n\nwxl 2439$57 \u2013 2025 \u0da2\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc3 05 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2025'06'05\n\nNo. 2439/57 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 05, 2025\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nRevocation under Section 39 (1)\n\nTHE allotment of land specified morefully in the Order No. 313 of 2012 dated 18.12.2012 made under the Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1789/29 dated 19.12.2012 was vested in the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. The possession of the land depicted below has not yet been taken for and on behalf of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. Therefore, I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, by virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 39(1) of the Land Acquisition Act, do hereby revoke order made in respect of the the lands specified in the Schedule of the Order No. 313 of 2012 dated 18.12.2012 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1789/29 dated 19.12.2012. K.D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/09. Land Acquiring officer's No.: WGSWD&EIP/ACQ/JP/01.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Land Secretariat,No.1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.20th May, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE"
