    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'02'06PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 06.02.2025\n\n1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Redemption Notices\n\nwxl 2439$56 \u2013 2025 cqks ui 05 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2025'06'05No. 2439/56 \u2013 THURSDAY, JUNE 05, 2025\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 044522 \u2013 14 (05/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nRevocation under Section 39 (1)\n\nTHE allotments of Land specified more fully in the Order\n\nNo. 317 of 2012 dated 18.12.2012 made under Proviso (a) to\n\nSection 38 of the Land Acquisition Act and published in the\n\nGazette Extraordinary No. 1789/30 dated 19.12.2012 was\n\nvested in the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka. The\n\nPossession of the land depicted below has not yet been taken\n\nfor and on behalf of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri\n\nLanka. Therefore, I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister\n\nof Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation by virtue\n\nof the power vested in me under Section 39(1) of the Land\n\nAcquisition Act, do hereby revoke the Order only in respect\n\nof the land specified in the Schedule of Order No. 317 of 2012\n\ndated 18.12.2012 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No.\n\n1789/30 deted 19.12.2012.\n\nK. D. Lal kantha,\n\nMinister of Agriculture,\n\nLivestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/13.\n\nLand Acquiring Officer's No.: WGSWD&EIP/ACQ/KB/01,\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock,\n\nLand and Irrigation,\n\n1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,\n\nRajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.\n\n20th May, 2025.\n\nIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'06'05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.06.2025 2A\n\nSCHEDULE"
