    "chunk_text": "20th May, 2025.\n\nIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'06'05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.06.2025 2A\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n01. Lot No. 43 \u2013 Land bearing No. 50/2 in Old Kesbewa Road (a portion) \u2013 Extent: 0.0016 Hectare North: Lot Nos. 41 and 42; East: Land bearing No. 50/2 in Old Kesbewa Road; South: Land bearing No. 50/2 in Old Kesbewa Road, Lot Nos. 46 and 45; West: Lot No. 44.\n\nEOG06 - 0059\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nCORRECTION PAPER\n\nThe Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460)\n\nOrder under Section 39(1)\n\nMy No: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/20. Land Acquiring Officer's Ref. No.: WGSWD&EIP/ ACQ/KB/05/. It is hereby declared that \u201cExtent of Lot No. E- 0.06168 Hectares\u201d under the descritption of Lots in the Schedule under\n\nSection 39(1) of the Land Acquisition Act, published in the three languages in Page 2A of the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2420/38 dated 22.01.2025 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, shall be rectified as \u201cExtent of No. E- 0.0618 Hectare\u201d.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.20th May, 2025.\n\nEOG 06 - 0061\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
