    "chunk_text": "The allotments speci\ufb01 ed in the Order No.71 of 2010 made under the Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1657/32 dated 11th June 2010 are vested absolutely in the State and the possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the State under Paragraph (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue of powers vested in me by Sub section (1) of Section 39 (a) (inserted by Act No.8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act, I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby divest only the allotments speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule below.\n\nK.D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAllotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Preliminary Plan No. .d 4014 dated 18.04.2013 (Tracing No. GA/AKM/06/67 dated 28.05.2006 prepared by the Surveyor General), situated in the Village called Panagamuwa in No.134 D, Bambaragoda Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Akmeemana in Galle District of Southern Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Poonakanda \u2013 Extent: 0.2000 Hectare North: Medagedara Watta (TP 105051) claimed by K.K.Yasoma Bandula & others; East: Medagedara Watta (TP 105051) claimed by K.K.Yasoma Bandula & others and Road; South: Road; West: Mahenegewatta (TP 105051) claimed by D.L.Somapala & others.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 \u2013 Poonakanda \u2013 Extent: 0.1802 Hectare North: Road; East: Road; South: Road and Mahenegewatta (TP 105051) claimed by D.L.Chandrawathi & others; West: Mahenegewatta (TP 105051) claimed by D.L. Chandrawathi & others and Road.\n\n03. Lot No. 4 \u2013 Poonakanda \u2013 Extent: 0.4527 Hectare North: Road; East: Road and Lot No. H 382 in PP 942; South: Road and Lot No. H 382 in PP 942; West: Road.\n\nEOG 06- 0057\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
